Checkpoint recurrent state where prefix caching actually matched.

A fine-hash speculative hit lands on a hash unit that the attention will drop
for speculative safety, so the recurrent-state checkpoint has to be taken at the
preceding unit. A mandatory physical-page boundary must not leave fewer known
inputs than the draft lookahead. Both rules are threaded through the hybrid
coordinator, the single-type manager and the scheduler.

